# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BMad workflow artefacts
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PRDs, epics, story files, sprint status, audit reports, distillates,
# and any other planning/agent output produced by the BMad skill suite.
# Kept entirely out of the repo — neither committed nor shipped in
# container images (the dockerignore mirrors these patterns).
# Patterns are wide so any future BMad layout variant (root
# `_bmad-output/`, scoped `_bmad/`, alternate `bmad-output/`) is also
# excluded.
